          </figure>
          <p>Five skills ship with <code class="inline">fetch_forge</code>:</p>
          <table class="scope">
            <tbody>
              <tr><th scope="row">fetch-forge-query</th><td>The Query read model: constructor config, ten signals, methods, disposal, behavior contracts.</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">fetch-forge-mutation</th><td>One-shot writes: mutate vs mutateAsync, reset, cache invalidation, disposal.</td></tr>
