              <tr><th scope="row">fetch-forge-flutter-widgets</th><td>The Flutter layer: QueryBuilder, MutationBuilder, QueryView, MutationView, QueryScope, autoFetch, the refresh and trigger signals, disposal, testing.</td></tr>
